  "description": "The civilian belt trades sustained protection for lower weight and cost. At Normal quality it holds 0.70 reserve, recharges at 0.10 per second and weighs 2 kg.\n\nThe field rises in combat and lowers while the wearer aims, fires and recovers. It blocks fast impacts but can be penetrated by skilled slow blades and specialist Drillshot darts. Heat, explosions and EMP bypass it; on exposed sand, its emissions attract Makers. Lasgun contact with an active field causes a dangerous local blast.",
