    "overview": {
      "body": "Blocked hits spend reserve and delay recharge for twelve seconds. A Melee 10 fighter can begin attempting deliberate blade penetration, while ordinary fast darts must exhaust the field. The waist utility slot prevents wearing another full-field belt or competing utility pack at the same time.\n\nA blue contour marks the active field, with blue blocking and red penetration or overload reactions. Read the reserve display as well as the visual effect; energy units are distinct from percentage. Civilian and reinforced configurations are frontier variations created for the mod."
    }
